name: abs-mode-toggle
description: >
  Minimal engine-off ROAD↔SUPERMOTO toggle hunt — baseline, navigate to ABS
  screen, four SET-holds with settles. Auto-marked at each SET-hold start.
  Scoped down from 2026-07-12-dash-inputs (trip reset + short-presses
  retired as dash-internal).
experiment: 2026-07-24-abs-mode-toggle

# Timing convention: marks fire at STEP START — the moment the rider is
# cued to begin the SET-hold. The bus broadcast is keyed off the press
# edge, not the dash redraw.
#
# Wifi-bridge is bike-powered (ADR 0018): the ESP is off until key-on,
# so capture starts after key-on. No pre-key-off silence window.
#
# Engine OFF throughout. If the first SET-hold produces no dash mode
# change, the ABS ECU likely requires engine-on — press q, abort, and
# re-run with starter + idle-settled steps added.
#
# 8 s settles between toggles comfortably exceed the 100 ms cycle of the
# slowest slow-decay IDs.

steps:
  # ---------------------------------------------------------------- Setup
  - prompt: "Key is already ON (wifi-bridge boots on ignition). Kill RUN, neutral, side stand down. Engine OFF throughout. Hands off the bike."
    duration_secs: 30
    mark: { key: mark, label: "post-key-on baseline (engine off)" }

  # ------------------------------------------- Navigate to ABS screen
  - prompt: "Use MODE short-presses to reach the ABS screen. The 4 s startup display already showed you the current mode — note it in session.md. Take your time."
    duration_secs: 30

  - prompt: "Get into position — finger on SET, ready to hold. Hands otherwise off the bike."
    duration_secs: 8

  # -------------------------------- Four toggles (round-trip to start)
  - repeat: 4
    steps:
      - prompt: "Hold SET 3–5 s — toggle mode. If iter 1 shows NO mode change on the dash, press q to abort (engine-on required). If the dash FLASHES the mode indicator, that's a fault — abort and diagnose."
        duration_secs: 10
        countdown_from: 3
        mark: { key: mode, label: "mode toggle {iter} of {loop_count} (SET-hold start)" }
      - prompt: "Settle — hands off, let the bus quiet down."
        duration_secs: 8

  # ----------------------------------------------------------- Shutdown
  - prompt: "Key OFF now. Hold 3 s of tail silence."
    duration_secs: 6

  - prompt: "Done. Press q to stop capture and fill in session.md (starting mode, whether toggle took effect, any dash anomalies)."
    duration_secs: null
